s Ram and Mohan, Ram secured 40% of the votes and was defeated by a majority of 1200 votes. Find the total number of recorded votes.", "options": [{"text": "7,000", "added": false}, {"text": "6,000", "added": false}, {"text": "5,000", "added": false}, {"text": "5,500", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Percentage", "sub": "basic-percentage", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 13, "text": "The marked price of an article is 25% above its cost price. If it is sold for ₹1,620 furthermore with 12.5% profit, then what is the discount percentage?", "options": [], "options_source": "missing", "image_only": false, "topic": "Discount", "sub": "mp-sp-relation", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 14, "text": "", "options": [{"text": "22 cm2", "added": false}, {"text": "24 cm2", "added": false}, {"text": "26 cm2", "added": false}, {"text": "20 cm2", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": true, "topic": "Mensuration 2D", "sub": "triangle-and-quadrilaterals", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 15, "text": "If two extreme terms of three continued proportional numbers be ab/c, ac/b, then the mean proportional is:", "options": [{"text": "b", "added": false}, {"text": "a", "added": false}, {"text": "ab", "added": false}, {"text": "ac", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Ratio-Proportion", "sub": "proportion", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 16, "text": "Find the maximum length of a pen that can be kept in a cuboid box of dimensions 6 cm × 4 cm × 2 cm.", "options": [{"text": "5√14 cm", "added": false}, {"text": "3√14 cm", "added": false}, {"text": "4√14 cm", "added": false}, {"text": "2√14 cm", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Mensuration 3D", "sub": "cube-cuboid", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 17, "text": "", "options": [], "options_source": "missing", "image_only": true, "topic": "Simplification", "sub": "bodmas", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 18, "text": "", "options": [{"text"